# Pokemon PureBlue (Vortyne/pureRGB) GameShark .cht for Game Station dual-screen
# Built from Vortyne/pureRGB pokeblue.sym (WRAM labels; Blue build CURRENT 2.7.6).
# ROM basename Dirt confirmed: PokemonBlue
#   PokemonBlue.gbc  ->  PokemonBlue.cht
# Path on SD: /gbc_cheats/PokemonBlue.cht
# PureBlue is Gen1 (pokered-based GBC), NOT GBA. GS codes are type 01/91.
# WARNING: wrong-hack / wrong-version codes can corrupt saves. Backup .sav first.
# Codes load DISABLED; press c in-game, enable only what you need.
# Each "+" part shows as its own menu row (desc #1, #2, ...): turn ON every
# row of the cheat you want, and turn them all OFF again afterwards.
# NEVER use "Enable all" (bag / mart / wild-force codes fight over the same bytes).
#
# === vs Polished Crystal 3.2.3 ===
# PureBlue/PureRGB is Gen1. Addresses are NOT PC addresses.
# BAG: single Items pocket (wNumBagItems D542, slot1 D543/D544). No Med/Ball
#   pockets. Capacity 30 (PureRGB). Money D34F / coins D5AC (after bag relocate).
# SHINY: SKIPPED — no Gen2 shiny personality system. Optional ALT PKMN COLORS
#   are regional palette variants, not shinies; cannot mirror PC D29F write.
# RUNNING SHOES: already in the hack as hold-B sprint (home/overworld.asm).
#   NOT a permanent always-on setting. GS type 01/91 cannot OR B into hJoyHeld
#   without wiping D-pad/A. Always-run cheat NOT added.
# LEGENDS: Dirt — WITHOUT any legend. Skip Mew/Mewtwo/Articuno/Zapdos/Moltres
#   and Gen2-only (Marill/Lugia/Ho-Oh/Pichu/Espeon/Umbreon). Keep Blue-native
#   wild-force: starters, Eevee line Gen1, Abra, Gastly, Mr. Mime.
# Party Level 100: SKIPPED per Dirt. Party happiness / All TMs / Big Nugget /
#   FIX rebuild rows: skipped (unmappable or not needed).
#
# BAG: overwrites bag slot 1. Bag must already hold >=1 item. ONE at a time.
# MART: patch Buy-menu row 1 only (wItemList+1 @ D0EA). Master Ball price = 0.
# WILD-FORCE: overwrite all 10 grass + 10 water SPECIES bytes (wGrassMons/
#   wWaterMons @ D890/D8AD). Levels stay map-native. ONE while hunting.
# PARTY: slot 1 only. Max StatExp = Gen1 EV analogue (D184–D18D).
#


